  - TextToChange: {fileID: 1047612802}
    TutText: You wont always start with enough resources
    timeToThis: 2
    TimeScaling: 0
    eventTrigger: 2
    lightIntensity: 0.25
  - TextToChange: {fileID: 1047612802}
    TutText: So you'll have to place a gatherer down to gain resources
    timeToThis: 0.5
    TimeScaling: 0
    eventTrigger: 2
    lightIntensity: 0.25
  - TextToChange: {fileID: 1905077064}
    TutText: Place a gatherer on their respective resource
    timeToThis: 0.5
    TimeScaling: 0
    eventTrigger: 1
    lightIntensity: 0.75
  - TextToChange: {fileID: 1905077064}
    TutText: Place another gatherer down to gain a different resource
    timeToThis: 0.5
    TimeScaling: 0
    eventTrigger: 1
    lightIntensity: 0.75
  - TextToChange: {fileID: 1047612802}
    TutText: Place a tower when you have enough
    timeToThis: 0.5
    TimeScaling: 1
    eventTrigger: 0
    lightIntensity: 1
  - TextToChange: {fileID: 1047612802}
    TutText: Continue defending by placing down towers. Good luck
